      "description": "Participated in the following development projects:\n\n1. Product Deployment\n\n• Defined tools and procedures to standardize deployment practices implemented by the product groups.\n\n• Actively participated in the design of a deployment process that would facilitate the implementation tasks of product groups, QA, and installation teams by automating the deployment of our products.\n\n2. Business Intelligence Solution\n\n• Contributed to the analysis and design of the Business Intelligence solution - a multi-dimensional data warehouse targeting the consolidation of a retail enterprise’s data from various source applications (Merchandising, Sales Analytics, and CRM) into a single enterprise-level view.\n\n• Designed and implemented an OLAP cube that was the core of the BI solution.\n\n• Implemented SharePoint web parts (scorecards) that utilized the OLAP cube, providing end-users with key metrics enabling them to track the enterprise’s performance and make informed decisions.\n\n3. Foundation Framework\n\n• Served as part of a team dedicated to providing our product groups with a stable and reliable architecture as well as services and classes that simplify and abstract the access and use of the .NET Framework API\n\n• Provided training for other developers to understand the Foundation Framework’s APIs and how it may be leveraged in the design of their applications.",
